                                        Use of DSA:
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>
                                                Graphs for user connections (friends/followers)
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Queues for managing news feeds
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                HashMaps for fast user profile lookups
                                            </li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        Example:
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>
                                                Showing your feed based on who you follow and whatâ€™s trending.
